<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<title>Financial KPIs in Restaurants Poster</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600&display=swap');

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

  body {
    background:#e9e9e9;
    font-family:'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:30px 10px;
  }

  .poster {
    width:800px;
    max-width:100%;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:10px solid #0d2036;
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:14px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }

  .inner {
    border:2px solid #d4af37;
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:22px 22px 18px 22px;
  }

  .title-box {
    background:#0d2036;
    border:2px solid #d4af37;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:16px 10px;
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }

  .title-box h1 {
    color:#ffffff;
    font-size:30px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    font-weight:800;
  }

  table {
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:8px;
  }

  thead th {
    background:#0d2036;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    padding:12px 8px;
    text-align:center;
    border:1px solid #0d2036;
  }

  thead th:first-child { width:26%; text-align:left; padding-left:20px; }

  tbody td {
    font-size:12.5px;
    padding:12px 10px;
    text-align:center;
    border-bottom:1px solid #e3d9c6;
    vertical-align:middle;
    color:#1c1c1c;
  }

  tbody tr:nth-child(odd) td { background:#faf6ee; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#fbe9e3; }

  .kpi-cell {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    text-align:left;
    padding-left:14px !important;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:#0d2036;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    flex:0 0 40px;
    width:40px;
    height:40px;
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#fff;
    box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  }

  .c1{background:#2f9bd6;}
  .c2{background:#5cb85c;}
  .c3{background:#8e6fce;}
  .c4{background:#f2a340;}
  .c5{background:#2fb7a6;}
  .c6{background:#e05d44;}
  .c7{background:#2f7fd6;}
  .c8{background:#c99a2e;}
  .c9{background:#a34a9c;}
  .c10{background:#4a7fbd;}

  .signature {
    margin-top:22px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:15px;
    color:#0d2036;
  }

  .signature span.name {
    font-family:'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size:28px;
    color:#0d2036;
    margin-left:8px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="infomatics-launcher">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="infomatics-btn" onclick="var p=document.getElementById('infomatics-panel');var open=p.classList.toggle('active');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open?'true':'false');" type="button">
    Infomatics
  </button>
<div class="infomatics-panel" id="infomatics-panel">
</div>
</div>
<style>
.infomatics-launcher{margin:2rem 0;}
.infomatics-btn{padding:0.6em 1.4em;border:none;border-radius:6px;background:#1f2937;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.infomatics-btn:hover{background:#374151;}
.infomatics-panel{display:none;margin-top:1rem;}
.infomatics-panel.active{display:block;}
</style>
<div class="infomatics-launcher">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="infomatics-btn" onclick="var p=document.getElementById('infomatics-panel');var open=p.classList.toggle('active');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open?'true':'false');" type="button">
    Infomatics
  </button>
<div class="infomatics-panel" id="infomatics-panel">
</div>
</div>
<style>
.infomatics-launcher{margin:2rem 0;}
.infomatics-btn{padding:0.6em 1.4em;border:none;border-radius:6px;background:#1f2937;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.infomatics-btn:hover{background:#374151;}
.infomatics-panel{display:none;margin-top:1rem;}
.infomatics-panel.active{display:block;}
</style>
<div class="infomatics-launcher">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="infomatics-btn" onclick="var p=document.getElementById('infomatics-panel');var open=p.classList.toggle('active');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open?'true':'false');" type="button">
    Infomatics
  </button>
<div class="infomatics-panel" id="infomatics-panel">

</div>
</div>
<style>
.infomatics-launcher{margin:2rem 0;}
.infomatics-btn{padding:0.6em 1.4em;border:none;border-radius:6px;background:#1f2937;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.infomatics-btn:hover{background:#374151;}
.infomatics-panel{display:none;margin-top:1rem;}
.infomatics-panel.active{display:block;}
</style>

<div class="infomatics-launcher">
<button aria-expanded="false" class="infomatics-btn" onclick="var p=document.getElementById('infomatics-panel');var open=p.classList.toggle('active');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open?'true':'false');" type="button">
    Infomatics
  </button>
<div class="infomatics-panel" id="infomatics-panel">
<div class="poster">
<div class="inner">
<div class="title-box">
<h1>FINANCIAL KPIs IN RESTAURANTS</h1>
</div>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>KPI</th>
<th>Formula</th>
<th>Purpose</th>
<th>Healthy Range</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c1">🍴</span>Food Cost %</td>
<td>(Cost of ingredients used ÷ Total food sales) × 100</td>
<td>Measure purchasing efficiency and food preparation</td>
<td>28% – 35%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c2">🥤</span>Beverage Cost %</td>
<td>(Cost of beverages sold ÷ Total beverage sales) × 100</td>
<td>Measure beverage management efficiency</td>
<td>20% – 25%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c3">👥</span>Labor Cost %</td>
<td>(Total wages and benefits ÷ Total revenue) × 100</td>
<td>Measure staffing efficiency relative to revenue</td>
<td>25% – 35%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c4">🧾</span>Average Check</td>
<td>Total revenue ÷ Total number of customers</td>
<td>Measure average spending per customer</td>
<td>Varies by restaurant type</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c5">⏱️</span>Sales per Labor Hour</td>
<td>Total sales ÷ Total labor hours</td>
<td>Measure employee productivity</td>
<td>Varies</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c6">📈</span>Gross Profit Margin</td>
<td>(Gross profit ÷ Total revenue) × 100</td>
<td>Measure profitability after deducting cost of goods sold</td>
<td>60% – 70%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c7">💰</span>Profit Margin</td>
<td>(Net profit ÷ Total revenue) × 100</td>
<td>Measure overall profitability</td>
<td>5% – 15%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c8">🍽️</span>Profitability</td>
<td>Selling price − Cost of ingredients</td>
<td>Identify the most profitable menu items</td>
<td>Regular analysis</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c9">⚖️</span>Prime Cost %</td>
<td>Food Cost % + Labor Cost %</td>
<td>Measure total controllable costs driving profitability</td>
<td>55% – 65%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="kpi-cell"><span class="icon-circle c10">📦</span>Inventory Turnover Ratio</td>
<td>Cost of goods sold ÷ Average inventory value</td>
<td>Measure how efficiently inventory is used and reduce waste</td>
<td>4 – 8x per month</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="signature">
      Signature: <span class="name">Nigel A. Thomas</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<style>
.infomatics-launcher{margin:2rem 0;}
.infomatics-btn{padding:0.6em 1.4em;border:none;border-radius:6px;background:#1f2937;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.infomatics-btn:hover{background:#374151;}
.infomatics-panel{display:none;margin-top:1rem;}
.infomatics-panel.active{display:block;}
</style>
</body>
</html>
